<title>SPAIN: Endesa starts buy offer for 75 pct Fecsa, Sevilla.</title>
<headline>Endesa starts buy offer for 75 pct Fecsa, Sevilla.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish stock market watchdog CNMV said on Friday that 66-percent state-owned Endesa was launching a buy offer of up to 75 percent of Fecsa at 1,100 a share and for 75 percent of Sevillana at 1,300 pesetas a share.</p>
<p>&quot;The CNMV has received a stock price relevant announcement in which Endesa announces a share offer of up to 75 percent for Sevillana and Fecsa,&quot; a CNMV spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
